# Files no project builds, tests or reads. Nx leaves them out of the graph, so
# editing them affects no project; the root project would otherwise own them and
# rerun the crate's suites for a docs-only change. README.md is not here: the
# crate packages it. Anything a target reads must never be listed.
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/docs/
